void FunctionName_float(float2 UV, float Size, float BranchCount, float BranchThickness, float4 Color, out float4 outColor)
{
    // PLAN:
    // 1) Map UV to centered coordinates and normalize by Size.
    // 2) Convert to polar coordinates and fold angle into a single branch sector.
    // 3) Build a main vertical branch using a box SDF.
    // 4) Add two diagonal side twigs via rotated boxes and union them.
    // 5) Optionally add a small core disk effect by tapering branch length near center.
    // 6) Use smoothstep for anti-aliasing and output solid color with alpha mask.

